            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Whistling Bones"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, aura, emotion, fear, mental)\n\n30 feet. Wind whistles through the namorrodor's jutting bones with an eerie tone.\n\nA creature entering or beginning its turn in the area must attempt a 19 Will save, becoming frightened 1 on a failure (frightened 2 on a critical failure). A creature can't reduce its frightened condition below 1 as long as it's in the aura."
